</p> </div> <picture data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" src="/assets/svgs/bathrooms-icon.svg" alt="bathrooms icon" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </picture> </li> </ul> </div> </section> <!-- ============================================ --> <!--                Side By Side                  --> <!-- ============================================ --> <section id="sbs-1639" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="cs-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="cs-content" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="cs-topper" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>About WB Trade</span> <h2 class="cs-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Domestic and Trade Plumbers Merchant</h2> <picture class="cs-picture" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <!--Mobile Image--> <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/assets/images/wb-trade-counter-1.webp" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <!--Tablet and above Image--> <source media="(min-width: 601px)" srcset="/assets/images/wb-trade-counter-1.webp" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/images/wb-trade-counter-1.webp" alt="trade counter" width="608" height="406" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </picture> </div> <div class="cs-stats-group" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <p class="cs-text" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Welcome to WB Trade Plumbing & Tiling Merchants. 
                    We are an independent, family-run supplier of plumbing, heating, tiling, 
                    and bathroom essentials based in the Ossett area of Wakefield, West Yorkshire.
</p> <p class="cs-text" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
We stock everyday essentials for plumbing, heating, tiling, 
                    and bathrooms—with 90% of our range available on a next-day service. 
                    If there’s something you regularly need and we don’t stock it, 
                    just ask—we’re always adding new lines based on customer feedback.
</p> <p class="cs-text" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
As a family-run business, we pride ourselves on friendly service, 
                    great prices, and building lasting relationships with our trade customers. 
                    Pop in for a coffee and a chat—we’re here to help.
</p> <ul class="cs-stats" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <li class="cs-stat" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="cs-number" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>500+</span> <span class="cs-desc" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Stocked Products</span> </li> <li class="cs-stat" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="cs-number" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>100s</span> <span class="cs-desc" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>of Satisfied Customers</span> </li> <li class="cs-stat" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="cs-number" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>70+</span> <span class="cs-desc" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Top Brands</span> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </section> </div>    <section id="sbs-r" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="cs-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <!-- Left Image Section --> <div class="cs-left" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <picture class="cs-picture cs-picture1" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/assets/images/wb-trade-counter-1.webp" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <source media="(min-width: 601px)" srcset="/assets/images/wb-trade-counter-1.webp" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" src="/assets/images/wb-trade-counter-1.webp" alt="house" loading="lazy" width="400" height="560" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </picture> <picture class="cs-picture cs-picture2" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/assets/images/wb-trade-storefront-1.webp" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <source media="(min-width: 601px)" srcset="/assets/images/wb-trade-storefront-1.webp" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" src="/assets/images/wb-trade-storefront-1.webp" alt="cabinets" loading="lazy" width="400" height="560" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </picture> </div> <!-- Right Content Section--> <div class="cs-right" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="cs-topper" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>WB Trade Counter</span> <h2 class="cs-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Our Trade Counter</h2> <p class="cs-text" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
The WB Trade Counter is at the core of what we do—built to support plumbers, 
          heating engineers, and tradespeople with the products and service they rely on every day. 
          Staffed by a knowledgeable, down-to-earth team, we offer a wide range of quality plumbing, 
          heating, tiling, and bathroom essentials, all at competitive prices.
</p> <p class="cs-text" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Whether you’re picking up daily supplies, need quick advice, 
          or just want a straightforward chat over a coffee, 
          our Trade Counter is here to make your job easier. 
          Fast, friendly, and focused on trade—just the way it should be.
</p> </div> </div> </section>    <section id="brands" class="brands" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="brands-heading" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <span class="cs-topper" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Our Brands</span> <h2 class="cs-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Brands We Stock</h2> <a aria-label="view more brands" href="/brands" class="cs-button-solid" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>View All Brands</a> </div> <div class="card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <picture data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" src="/assets/images/brands/ox-tools-logo.webp" alt="OX Tools Logo" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </picture> <h2 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>OX Tools</h2> </div> <div class="card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <picture data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" src="/assets/images/brands/floplast-logo.webp" alt="FloPlast Logo" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </picture> <h2 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>FloPlast</h2> </div> <div class="card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <picture data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" src="/assets/images/brands/ideal-heating-logo.webp" alt="Ideal Heating Logo" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </picture> <h2 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Ideal Heating</h2> </div> <div class="card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <picture data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" src="/assets/images/brands/geberit-logo.webp" alt="Geberit Logo" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> </picture> <h2 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Geberit</h2> </div> </section>    <section id="sbs" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="cs-container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <!-- Left Image Section --> <div class="cs-left" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <picture class="cs-picture cs-picture1" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <source media="(max-width: 600px)" srcset="/assets/images/bathrooms-image-5.webp" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> 